\code{px_get_data()} is \code{get_data()} under a name no sister package exports.
rTrafa also exports a \code{get_data()}, so in a script that attaches both, the
package attached last masks the other and its calls fail on the wrong
argument check. Use \code{px_get_data()} here and \code{rTrafa::trafa_get_data()}
there, or prefix every call with its package.
